{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "在 Scanpy 1.11.2 中，flavor='seurat_v3' 时输入应为计数数据，而不是对数化数据。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "Expects logarithmized data, except when `flavor='seurat_v3'`/`'seurat_v3_paper'`, in which count data is expected."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的矩阵状态是 raw_integer_counts，符合 seurat_v3 对计数输入的期望。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:matrix_state"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "seurat_v3 会先对每个基因做带正则化标准差的标准化，再计算标准化后方差并按该方差排序。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "First, the data are standardized (i.e., z-score normalization per feature) with a regularized standard deviation. Next, the normalized variance is computed as the variance of each gene after the transformation. Genes are ranked by the normalized variance."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "该函数用于标注高变基因，因此当前计数矩阵可以直接作为输入。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 3,
          "quote": "Annotate highly variable genes :cite:p:`Satija2015,Zheng2017,Stuart2019`."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：n_top_genes 在 flavor='seurat_v3' 下是必需参数；你已提供 n_top_genes=2000，因此该条件已满足。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 6,
          "quote": "n_top_genes\n        Number of highly-variable genes to keep. Mandatory if `flavor='seurat_v3'`."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供 batch_key=null，因此不需要按批次排序或处理批次间并列关系。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:batch_key"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "clarification": null
}
